  "original_summary": "\r\n\r\n1. Inputs and outputs of the method:\r\n\r\nInputs:\r\n\r\n* `ModuleElement mdle`: The `ModuleElement` object representing the module for which the meta keywords are to be generated.\r\n\r\nOutputs:\r\n\r\n* `List<String>`: A list of meta keywords for the given module. If the `config.keywords` flag is set to `true`, the list will contain a single element, which is the qualified name of the module followed by the string \"module\". If the flag is set to `false`, the list will be empty.\r\n\r\n2. Business purpose:\r\n\r\nThe purpose of this method is to generate meta keywords for a given module. The meta keywords are used for search engine optimization (SEO) and are typically included in the HTML head of a web page. The method takes a `ModuleElement` object as input and returns a list of meta keywords.\r\n\r\n3. Deta"
